    "body": "For some compliance frameworks you need to log users out automatically after a certain period of inactivity.\r\n\r\nNotification polling kills our auto-logout: you never get more than 30 sec inactivity. It should be ignored when determining the inactive period of a user. Same with heartbeat and perhaps other things.",
